msgid "Android in-app purchases"
msgstr "Compras no aplicativo em Android"

msgid ""
"Godot provides the first-party `GodotGooglePlayBilling <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-google-play-billing>`_ Android plugin for integrating the "
"`Google Play Billing library <https://developer.android.com/google/play/"
"billing>`_, enabling applications distributed through Google Play to offer "
"one-time purchases and subscriptions."
msgstr ""
"A Godot fornece o plugin oficial para Android `GodotGooglePlayBilling "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot-google-play-billing>`_ para integração "
"com a `biblioteca do Google Play Billing <https://developer.android.com/"
"google/play/billing>`_, permitindo que aplicativos distribuídos através da "
"Google Play ofereçam compras únicas e assinaturas."

msgid ""
"For installation, setup instructions, and the API reference, see the "
"`GodotGooglePlayBilling documentation <https://godot-sdk-"
"integrations.github.io/godot-google-play-billing/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Para instalação, instruções de configuração e a referência da API, consulte "
"a `documentação do GodotGooglePlayBilling <https://godot-sdk-"
"integrations.github.io/godot-google-play-billing/>`_."
